  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kidney Transplant Surgery for Malik</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fair Life Africa Foundation seeks your support to raise funds for Malik, a 33 year old man from Agenebode, Edo State.  Malik is a 2017 graduate of Quantity Surveyor from the Federal University of Technology, Minna, Nigeria. Malik is currently ongoing treatment for kidney disease but desperately needs a transplant. His brother is ready to donate a kidney, but they need N12,000,000 or $15,000 for the surgery at Lagos University Teaching Hospital.  Please donate what you can. Thanks!</narrative>
  </description>
